  "keyFeatures": [
    "Modular multi-project Gradle build (40+ subprojects) for a Spring Boot core banking platform",
    "Multi-tenant runtime with per-tenant DataSource resolution and Liquibase-managed tenant-store/tenant schemas",
    "Jersey JAX-RS API layer with 111+ ApiResource endpoints exposing loans, savings, accounting, and admin operations",
    "Command-source / maker-checker framework with handlers, idempotency, and async/disruptor/JDBC variants",
    "Batch API service that fans out internal command strategies in a single HTTP call",
    "Cumulative and Progressive loan schedule generators, EMI calculator, and transaction processors",
    "Close-of-Business (COB) Spring Batch pipeline with pluggable LoanCOB business steps and inline COB",
    "Scheduled Jobs framework on top of Spring Batch with Quartz-style scheduler + Tasklet/Config per job",
    "Business-event bus and external-event producer pipeline with Avro schemas and queue/topic adapters",
    "Accounting subsystem: GL accounts, journal entries, accounting rules, financial activity, provisioning, trial balance",
    "Savings, Fixed Deposit, Recurring Deposit accounts and GSIM/GLIM individual monitoring",
    "Share accounts and dividend posting",
    "Investor / asset-externalization module (loan transfer to investors with dedicated COB steps)",
    "Working-capital loan module with breach/near-breach detection and dedicated COB pipeline",
    "Loan origination module covering application workflows",
    "Document management and pluggable content stores (filesystem and S3)",
    "Email and SMS campaign engines with messaging gateways and report mailing jobs",
    "Interoperation API for Mojaloop / open-banking style account lookups and transfers",
    "Mix XBRL reporting module and SPM (Social Performance Management) surveys and scorecards",
    "Credit bureau integration framework",
    "Two-factor authentication and OIDC federation in addition to basic auth and OAuth2",
    "Hooks framework for webhook delivery to external systems",
    "Notification cache, in-app notifications, and templates (Mustache)",
    "Data tables and ad-hoc query engine for tenant-extensible schemas",
    "Reports module (Pentaho/JasperReports integration) and report mailing jobs",
    "Generated Java SDK (fineract-client) and Feign variant (fineract-client-feign)",
    "Avro schema package (fineract-avro-schemas) shared with external consumers",
    "End-to-end Cucumber test runner (fineract-e2e-tests-runner) with feature catalogue",
    "Custom-module loader: settings.gradle dynamically includes custom/<company>/<category>/<module>",
    "Spring Boot war packaging (fineract-war) for legacy servlet-container deploys"
  ],
